Two-Level Fusion 2Level_V1: 4 views → 2-level hierarchical fusion
  L1: within-topology (spatial pair + expr pair)
  L2: cross-topology (ConcatProj+residual)
  CL: 4 pairs ICL + ClusterCL, Recon: MSE
  kappa=0.03×2(cross) + 0.02×2(same) = 0.10

